  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Above the mortal duel for smoky warm jade field he sits with Shang and Tie clan Gu Immortals on a white cloud. He stays silent while watching, noting that Hou clan is weakest now but can still win if Tie and Shang both take losses.",
      "chapters": [
        1532
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tie_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_hou_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Qing Qing later says he and Tie Mian Shen took Ye Fan for an external Gu Immortal seed from Shang clan’s arena system.",
      "chapters": [
        1533
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_qing_qing",
        "char_tie_mian_shen",
        "char_ye_fan",
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is rank six with Shang Qing Qing and cannot handle the ancient water monster alone; only rank seven Tie Mian Shen can lead that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1534
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan appears he stares wide-eyed and goes tongue-tied, knowing who Fang Yuan is but unable to speak the name.",
      "chapters": [
        1535
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reflected killer moves and myriad dragons later smash his body to bits; Fang Yuan imprisons his soul.",
      "chapters": [
        1536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
